{"seq":2,"slug":"btree-cell-record-varint-overflow","title":"表/索引 B-Tree、cell 与记录格式（varint serial type、溢出页）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/sqlite-embedded-database-internals-engineering/file-format-page-btree/btree-cell-record-varint-overflow","wordCount":2296,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"表-索引-b-tree-cell-与记录格式-varint-serial-type-溢出页\">表/索引 B-Tree、cell 与记录格式（varint serial type、溢出页）</h1><p>跨境电商的移动端 App、POS 收银机和边缘网关里，SQLite 库文件往往在设备上躺好几年，中间经历 App 升级、SKU 从 3000 涨到 12 万。某天你会看到 <code>.db</code> 从 180MB 膨胀到 1.2GB，或者一次「按条码查商品」从 0.3ms 变成 40ms。这些现象全部能在<strong>页（page）→ B-Tree cell → 记录（record）</strong> 这条链路上找到解释：一张商品缩略图被切成 100 个溢出页，每次查询就多读 100 次页；一个 <code>price</code> 存成 TEXT 而非 INTEGER，每行白白多花 6 个字节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-页类型-文件头与-b-tree-分层\">核心概念：页类型、文件头与 B-Tree 分层</h2><p>SQLite 数据库文件是<strong>定长页</strong>的数组，页号从 1 开始，页 N 的起始偏移是 <code>(N-1) × page_size</code>。页大小由文件头偏移 16 处的两字节大端整数决定，取值必须是 512–32768 之间的 2 的幂；<strong>写 1 表示 65536</strong>（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/fileformat2.html\">sqlite.org/fileformat2.html</a> §1.2）。第 1 页特殊：它以 100 字节文件头开始，之后才是该页自身的页头与 cell 内容，可用空间少 100 字节。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>偏移</th>\n<th>大小</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>魔数 <code>&quot;SQLite format 3\\000&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>页大小（大端；1 表示 65536）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>18 / 19</td>\n<td>1 / 1</td>\n<td>文件格式写入/读取版本（1=legacy journal，2=WAL）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><strong>每页保留字节数</strong> <code>reserved</code>（通常 0）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>32 / 36</td>\n<td>4 / 4</td>\n<td>空闲列表首 trunk 页号 / 总空闲页数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>56</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>文本编码（1=UTF-8，2/3=UTF-16le/be）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>可用空间 <code>U = page_size − reserved</code></strong> 是后面所有阈值公式的输入。<code>reserved</code> 是给加密留的口子：SQLCipher 与官方 SEE 占用 16/32/48 字节存放每页的 IV 与 HMAC（<a href=\"https://www.zetetic.net/sqlcipher/design/\">zetetic.net/sqlcipher/design</a>），<code>U</code> 因此从 4096 降到 4064 甚至更低。B-Tree 有四种页类型，用页头第一个字节标识：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;页 1 文件头&lt;br/&gt;100 字节&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;sqlite_schema&lt;br/&gt;根页(表 B-Tree)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;页类型 5&lt;br/&gt;表内部页 interior table&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;页类型 13&lt;br/&gt;表叶子页 leaf table&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;行 id + 记录载荷&lt;br/&gt;payload&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F[&quot;页类型 2/10&lt;br/&gt;索引 B-Tree&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;溢出页链&lt;br/&gt;4 字节 next 指针&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[\"页 1 文件头&lt;br/&gt;100 字节\"] --&gt; B[\"sqlite_schema&lt;br/&gt;根页(表 B-Tree)\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"页类型 5&lt;br/&gt;表内部页 interior table\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"页类型 13&lt;br/&gt;表叶子页 leaf table\"]\n  C --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[\"行 id + 记录载荷&lt;br/&gt;payload\"]\n  D --&gt; F[\"页类型 2/10&lt;br/&gt;索引 B-Tree\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"溢出页链&lt;br/&gt;4 字节 next 指针\"]\n  G --&gt; G</pre><p>页内部结构自底向下：页头（叶子 8 字节、内部 12 字节）之后紧跟<strong>单元指针数组</strong>（每项 2 字节，按 key 升序排列），单元内容区从页尾向页头方向增长，中间空隙由「第一个空闲块指针」与「碎片字节数」描述。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>页类型</th>\n<th>编号</th>\n<th>载荷</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表内部页</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>无载荷，只有子页号 + rowid</td>\n<td>扇出最大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表叶子页</td>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>rowid + 整行记录</td>\n<td>受记录大小限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引内部页</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>有载荷，参与溢出算法</td>\n<td>扇出小于表内部页</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引叶子页</td>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>完整索引键记录</td>\n<td>占用约为数据量的两倍</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"leaf-interior-cell-的字节布局\">Leaf/Interior Cell 的字节布局</h2><p>四种 cell 的前缀各不相同，但都遵守「变长整数打头、定长指针收尾」的写法（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/fileformat2.html\">sqlite.org/fileformat2.html</a> §2.1）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>表叶子 cell（13）</strong>：<code>varint 载荷长度 P</code> | <code>varint rowid</code> | payload | 若溢出则跟 4 字节溢出页号</li>\n<li><strong>表内部 cell（5）</strong>：<code>4 字节左子页号</code> | <code>varint rowid key</code>（无载荷）</li>\n<li><strong>索引叶子 cell（10）</strong>：<code>varint P</code> | payload | 若溢出则跟 4 字节溢出页号</li>\n<li><strong>索引内部 cell（2）</strong>：<code>4 字节左子页号</code> | <code>varint P</code> | payload | 若溢出则跟 4 字节溢出页号</li>\n</ul>\n<p>表内部 cell <strong>不携带 payload</strong>——键是 rowid，值在叶子层。索引 B-Tree 相反：内部页也存真实键值副本，所以索引占用越接近「数据量 × 2」。单元指针数组<strong>有序</strong>，页内定位因此是二分查找；<code>rowid</code> 插入必须维持顺序，这就是随机 rowid（如 UUID 转整数）导致大量页分裂与写放大的原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"varint-与-serial-type-编解码\">varint 与 serial type 编解码</h2><p>SQLite 的 varint 是<strong>大端、每字节 7 位有效</strong>的变长无符号整数，1–9 字节；前 8 个字节各贡献 7 位并留高位作延续标记，<strong>第 9 个字节贡献完整 8 位</strong>，因此覆盖整个 64 位空间（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/fileformat2.html\">sqlite.org/fileformat2.html</a> §2.6）。设变长部分有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 字节：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（前 </mtext><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> 字节）</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>9</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>（第 9 字节）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\sum_{i=0}^{n-2} b_i \\cdot 2^{7(n-1-i)} \\quad\\text{（前 } n-1 \\text{ 字节）},\\qquad v_{9} = \\sum_{i=0}^{7} b_i \\cdot 2^{7-i} \\quad\\text{（第 9 字节）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（前</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节）</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（第</span><span class=\"mord\"> 9 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实测对照：<code>0</code>→<code>00</code>（1 字节），<code>127</code>→<code>7f</code>（1 字节），<code>128</code>→<code>81 00</code>（2 字节），<code>16383</code>→<code>ff 7f</code>（2 字节），<code>16384</code>→<code>81 80 00</code>（3 字节）。选错类型立刻体现：一个 32 位整数时间戳只需 5 字节 varint，存成 TEXT 的 <code>&quot;2026-10-06T12:00:00Z&quot;</code> 就是 20 字节字符串加 1 字节类型头。</p>\n<p><strong>serial type</strong> 是记录体内每个字段的类型码，它同时决定了字段的字节数（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/fileformat2.html\">sqlite.org/fileformat2.html</a> §2.7）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>serial type</th>\n<th>存储类</th>\n<th>字节数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>NULL</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 / 2 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 6</td>\n<td>INTEGER（8/16/24/32/48/64 位，大端补码）</td>\n<td>1/2/3/4/6/8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>REAL（IEEE 754 双精度大端）</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8 / 9</td>\n<td>INTEGER 0 / INTEGER 1</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\ge 12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 偶</td>\n<td>BLOB</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N-12)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>13</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\ge 13</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span></span></span></span></span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 奇</td>\n<td>TEXT（UTF-8 或 UTF-16，随库编码）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>13</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N-13)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个反直觉但有用的推论：<strong>0 和 1 不占字节</strong>（serial type 8/9），订单状态用 <code>0=待支付,1=已支付</code> 省下的不只是字符串长度；<strong>INTEGER 与 REAL 永不共享字节</strong>，<code>price</code> 存分是 1–8 字节、存元固定 8 字节，而 <code>typeof()</code> 返回的类型名源自 serial type 而非列声明——这是 SQLite「动态类型」的物理来源，也是类型亲和性（type affinity）的落点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"记录载荷与溢出页溢出算法\">记录载荷与溢出页溢出算法</h2><p><strong>记录（record）</strong> 由两段组成：头部与体部（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/fileformat2.html\">sqlite.org/fileformat2.html</a> §2.8）。头部是 <code>varint 头部总长 H</code>（含它自己）后跟每个字段的 serial type varint；体部按声明顺序紧排各字段的原始字节。一个 4 列行的最小头部开销是 <code>1 + 4 = 5 字节</code>。当 payload 大于页内阈值时，SQLite 把<strong>尾部</strong>切到溢出页链上，但保留一段「本地载荷」以最大化同页可寻址性。设页可用空间为 <code>U</code>、payload 为 <code>P</code>，规则来自规范 §2.2：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>表叶</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>35</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>X</mi><mtext>索引</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><mn>255</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X_{\\text{表叶}} = U - 35,\\qquad X_{\\text{索引}} = \\left\\lfloor\\frac{(U-12)\\times 64}{255}\\right\\rfloor - 23</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">表叶</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">索引</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">255</span></span></span><span 