e=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>判定逻辑：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P \\le X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 则全部本地、无溢出；否则本地取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K \\le X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>，保证最后的溢出页尽量填满）或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K &gt; X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span>），溢出字节数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>本地</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= P - \\text{本地}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本地</span></span></span></span></span></span>。以默认的 <code>page_size = 4096</code>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4096</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U = 4096</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span></span></span></span></span> 代入：表叶子阈值为 <strong>4061</strong> 字节；索引阈值为 <strong>1002</strong> 字节，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>489</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = 489</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">489</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>这意味着：<strong>索引记录比表记录更早溢出</strong>，因为索引页要预留 12 字节头且分数只有 64/255。一个 1.2KB 的 TEXT 主键在表里安然无恙，作为索引键就会切出一个溢出页。溢出页自身是「4 字节下一页指针 + <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U-4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 字节数据」的链表，最后一页指针为 0；一张 200KB 的商品主图按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4092</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U-4 = 4092</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4092</span></span></span></span></span> 切分需要约 50 个溢出页，读取时要顺着链表走 50 次页读取。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;payload P = 8000 字节&lt;br/&gt;U = 4096&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;P &lt;= X ?&quot;}&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;否(表叶 X=4061)&quot;| C[&quot;计算 M 与 K&lt;br/&gt;M=489&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D{&quot;K &lt;= X ?&quot;}&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;本地 = K&lt;br/&gt;剩余进溢出链&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F[&quot;本地 = M = 489&lt;br/&gt;剩余进溢出链&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; G[&quot;4 字节页号指针&lt;br/&gt;→ 溢出页 1 → 溢出页 2 ...&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| H[&quot;整行留在页内&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"payload P = 8000 字节&lt;br/&gt;U = 4096\"] --&gt; B{\"P &lt;= X ?\"}\n  B --&gt;|\"否(表叶 X=4061)\"| C[\"计算 M 与 K&lt;br/&gt;M=489\"]\n  C --&gt; D{\"K &lt;= X ?\"}\n  D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"本地 = K&lt;br/&gt;剩余进溢出链\"]\n  D --&gt;|\"否\"| F[\"本地 = M = 489&lt;br/&gt;剩余进溢出链\"]\n  E --&gt; G[\"4 字节页号指针&lt;br/&gt;→ 溢出页 1 → 溢出页 2 ...\"]\n  F --&gt; G\n  B --&gt;|\"是\"| H[\"整行留在页内\"]</pre><h2 id=\"移动端与边缘部署的实测取舍\">移动端与边缘部署的实测取舍</h2><p>在 Android/iOS 的 NAND 闪存上，页大小与写入放大直接相关。SQLite 默认 <code>page_size = 4096</code>（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_page_size\">sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_page_size</a>），恰好覆盖多数 eMMC/UFS 逻辑块，因此<strong>大多数跨境电商 App 不应改动它</strong>；只有库文件只读随包分发、以顺序扫描为主时，把 <code>page_size</code> 提到 8192/16384 才可能减少 B-Tree 层数。改动必须在库为空时进行或在 <code>VACUUM</code> 前设置——<code>PRAGMA page_size</code> 对已有内容的库不会立刻生效，需要 <code>PRAGMA page_size=8192; VACUUM;</code> 重建（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/lang_vacuum.html\">sqlite.org/lang_vacuum.html</a>）。</p>\n<p>度量手段是 <code>dbstat</code> 虚拟表（需 <code>SQLITE_ENABLE_DBSTAT_VTAB</code>，<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/dbstat.html\">sqlite.org/dbstat.html</a>），它按表统计页数、payload 字节与填充率，用来定位「哪张表在制造溢出页」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT name, pagetype, ncell, payload,&#10;       ROUND(payload * 1.0 / pgsize, 3) AS fill_ratio&#10;FROM dbstat WHERE name = &#39;product&#39;&#10;ORDER BY payload DESC LIMIT 10;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, pagetype, ncell, payload,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(payload </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pgsize, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fill_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dbstat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'product'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> payload </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>（单条 BLOB/TEXT 默认上限 1e9 字节、页数上限 2^32−2 页，见 <a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/limits.html\">sqlite.org/limits.html</a>。）针对跨境电商场景，几条可直接落地的记录瘦身原则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>金额一律用整数分</strong>。<code>price_cents INTEGER</code> 走 serial type 1–4（1–4 字节），<code>price REAL</code> 固定 8 字节；50 万行商品表可省约 2MB，且消除浮点比较误差。枚举用 0/1（serial type 8/9 零字节），订单状态、上下架标志基本零成本。</li>\n<li><strong>短维度表用 <code>WITHOUT ROWID</code></strong>。把 <code>sku</code> 这类 TEXT 主键表声明为 <code>WITHOUT ROWID</code> 后它就是一棵索引 B-Tree，键即主键，省掉独立 rowid 列与它的 varint（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/withoutrowid.html\">sqlite.org/withoutrowid.html</a>）；代价是主键不能再更新。</li>\n<li><strong>图片绝不放主表</strong>。主图、详情图放文件系统或对象存储，库内只存路径或哈希；非要内联就明确接受「每行几十个溢出页」的代价，或在应用层切成 4–8KB 分片。</li>\n<li><strong>PII 与合规</strong>。收件人姓名、电话、地址属个人数据，用 <code>reserved</code> 给加密留位或开启 <code>PRAGMA secure_delete = ON</code>，让删除后的页内容被零填充（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_secure_delete\">sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_secure_delete</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>发布前跑 <code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code></strong>。它逐页校验 cell 指针数组、溢出链与 freelist 一致性（<a href=\"https://www.sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_integrity_check\">sqlite.org/pragma.html#pragma_integrity_check</a>），是发现「写了一半断电导致悬空溢出指针」的唯一可靠手段。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据库文件是定长页数组，<code>page_size</code> 在文件头偏移 16，写 1 表示 65536；<code>U = page_size − reserved</code> 是后续全部阈值的输入。B-Tree 有表（5/13）与索引（2/10）两族、内部与叶子两类；表内部 cell 不带载荷，索引内部 cell 带载荷。cell 用 varint 打头、4 字节页号收尾，单元指针数组按 key 有序。</li>\n<li>varint 每字节 7 位、最多 9 字节；serial type 0/8/9 零字节，是瘦身最直接的杠杆。记录由 <code>varint 头部长度</code> + 各字段类型码 + 体部组成，4 列行固定开销 5 字节。</li>\n<li>溢出阈值为表叶 <code>U−35</code>、索引 <code>⌊(U−12)×64/255⌋−23</code>；默认页（<code>U=4096</code>）下分别是 4061 与 1002 字节，索引比表更早溢出。</li>\n<li>移动端不要随手改页大小，先用 <code>dbstat</code> 定位溢出页来源，再考虑整数分金额、零字节枚举、<code>WITHOUT ROWID</code> 维度表与「图片不进主表」。</li>\n<li>本章页内结构到此为止：文件头逐字段定标与 <code>sqlite_schema</code> 解析见同章 <a href=\"db-file-header-page-types\">数据库文件头、页类型与页大小（schema 解析）</a>；空闲页链表、<code>integrity_check</code> 边界与损坏后的 <code>.recover</code> 路径见 <a href=\"freelist-integrity-check-corruption-repair\">空闲页链表、完整性校验与文件损坏恢复</a>。章节目录见 <a href=\"./\">INDEX.md</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"表/索引 B-Tree、cell 与记录格式（varint serial type、溢出页）","id":"表-索引-b-tree-cell-与记录格式-varint-serial-type-溢出页"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：页类型、文件头与 B-Tree 分层","id":"核心概念-页类型-文件头与-b-tree-分层"},{"level":2,"text":"Leaf/Interior Cell 的字节布局","id":"leaf-interior-cell-的字节布局"},{"level":2,"text":"varint 与 serial type 编解码","id":"varint-与-serial-type-编解码"},{"level":2,"text":"记录载荷与溢出页溢出算法","id":"记录载荷与溢出页溢出算法"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端与边缘部署的实测取舍","id":"移动端与边缘部署的实测取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据库文件头、页类型与页大小（schema 解析）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/sqlite-embedded-database-internals-engineering/file-format-page-btree/db-file-header-page-types"},"next":{"title":"空闲页链表、完整性校验与文件损坏恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/sqlite-embedded-database-internals-engineering/file-format-page-btree/freelist-integrity-check-corruption-repair"}}